# find_csv_in_matched_folders.py

## 配置区
`ROOT_SEARCH_PATH` / `FOLDER_PATTERN` / `MOVE_DIR`|`COPY_DIR`  
`RUN_SENSITIVITY` / `SENSITIVITY_OUT_CSV` / `PAK_NUM` / `SENS_ACCURACY`  
`RUN_SENSITIVITY_RADAR` / `SENSITIVITY_RADAR_DIR`

## 功能
- 路径解析 → band, phymode, 20m, ldpc, he …
- testcase_folder → `mld_en`, `cur_degree`（当前角度 °）
- 灵敏度（wifiRxPlot 算法）→ `sensitivity_summary_*.csv`
- 宽表 mld_en0/1；雷达：r=r0+signed diff，diff 刻度圆 + 点标注，恶化场景 zoom 到实测 diff 区间
- 可选 copy/move、list-out TSV

## 运行
```bash
python find_csv_in_matched_folders.py
python find_csv_in_matched_folders.py --sensitivity-out D:\out\sens.csv --radar-dir D:\out\radar
python find_csv_in_matched_folders.py --no-radar
```

